### BankEase API — open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension
@host = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Health
GET {{host}}/ping

### Login (copy the token from the response)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "10012345", "pin": "1234" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Accounts
GET {{host}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One account
GET {{host}}/accounts/BE1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statement (paged)
GET {{host}}/accounts/BE1001/transactions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Beneficiaries
GET {{host}}/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a beneficiary
POST {{host}}/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kiran Rao", "accountNumber": "555666777888", "ifsc": "BKEN0009999" }

### Transfer ₹500 (change the key for each new transfer)
POST {{host}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountId": "BE1001", "beneficiaryId": "B1", "amountPaise": 50000, "remarks": "chai" }

### Replay the SAME key: same receipt, money moves only once
POST {{host}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountId": "BE1001", "beneficiaryId": "B1", "amountPaise": 50000, "remarks": "chai" }

### Teaching: make the API slow
GET {{host}}/dev/chaos?delayMs=3000

### Teaching: make it fail half the time
GET {{host}}/dev/chaos?failRate=0.5

### Teaching: full outage (503)
GET {{host}}/dev/chaos?down=true

### Back to normal
GET {{host}}/dev/chaos/reset

### Teaching: expire every token (next call returns 401)
GET {{host}}/dev/expire-token

### Logout
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
